# Portfolio Project Rules

## Stack

- Next.js 16 App Router on Cloudflare Workers via `@opennextjs/cloudflare`
- TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4, Framer Motion
- Deploy with `npm run deploy` (or Workers Builds connected to the repo)

## i18n (Single Site)

- One site — NOT separate EN/FA sites
- Locales: `en` (default), `fa` via client-side `LanguageProvider`
- Translation files: `src/i18n/messages/{locale}.json`
- Language toggle switches text + `dir` (ltr/rtl) without changing routes
- All user-facing text MUST go through dictionary files
- Routes are locale-free: `/`, `/projects`, `/contact`

## Data Layer

- Profile data: `src/data/profile.ts`
- Projects data: `src/data/projects.ts` (add projects one by one)

## UI Conventions

- Dark theme only — blue/cyan/green neon palette
- Hero uses `NeuralNetworkBackground` canvas (not terminal)
- Use `GlassCard`, `NeonOrb`, `AnimatedSection` for UI

## Adding Pages

- New pages go under `src/app/`
- Use `generateStaticParams()` for dynamic routes
- Use `useLanguage()` hook in client components for translations

## Images

- Place assets in `public/images/`
- `next/image` uses Cloudflare Images binding (`IMAGES` in `wrangler.jsonc`)
